#: 83d6842f04bb4aba8eedc46b74770f49
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses D-Shot then all channels in the group need to use D-Shot. BiDirectional DShot available on the first 8 outputs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:121
#: efd2d1d1fd8b42cc909a0d758b7f9b52
