#: 50da92f3f80e47c287d04689677d5739
msgid "The board has two ADC input channels for Voltage (0-3.3v) and Current (0-3.3v) measurement. Settings are dependent on the external hardware used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:126
#: 1a7ba5d9c5484057bb564f67f9a10faa
msgid "Ethernet (Green Fade)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:128
#: 7f7300aacacb4d0a96a51aef6e9145f4
msgid "Ethernet is available on 4 output pads and has internal magnetics supporting direct connection to external equipment, no need for a large RJ45 connector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:131
#: a3170681dc174ab6ba19daf3289b691c
msgid "Compass"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-StampH743.rst:133
#: 28dba4d249fc41759d75d912ed169a47
msgid "The H743 Stamp has a built in compass, the BMM150. Due to potential interference the board is usually used with an external I2C or CAN compass as part of a GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr ""

